<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese insurance premiums up 9.9 pct yr/yr Jan.</title>
<headline>Portuguese insurance premiums up 9.9 pct yr/yr Jan.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total volume of insurance premiums paid to Portuguese insurers rose by 9.9 percent year-on-year to 71.569 billion escudos in January, the Portuguese Insurers' Association (APS) said.</p>
<p>Life insurance premiums rose 26.6 percent year-on-year to 15.47 billion escudos and non-life premiums rose 6.0 percent to 56.099 billion, a statement said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
